  Text: |-
    Tic Tac Toe is a Connected Lens: play a 3D game of Tic Tac Toe with a friend in the same room.
    
    Pinch Multiplayer to join a shared session with someone nearby. The first player is X, the second is O.
    
    Take turns: grab your piece with a pinch and drop it on a free spot of the 3×3×3 grid. Line up three in any direction, even across layers, to win.
